1. collection/redpajama_arxiv_cleaner_standalone.py
   Adapted from togethercomputer/RedPajama-Data, branch rp_v1, file
   data_prep/arxiv/arxiv_cleaner.py
   (https://github.com/togethercomputer/RedPajama-Data). The LaTeX cleaning
   functions are ported unchanged into a standalone script that uses only the
   Python standard library. The original's language identification and batch
   driver are not included.

2. training/posttrain/ds_configs/stage2_no_offloading_accelerate.conf
   A copy of configs/ds_configs/stage2_accelerate.conf of allenai/open-instruct
   at commit fc7748e (https://github.com/allenai/open-instruct), identical
   apart from the final newline. It is stored under the file name that our DPO
   command uses.

3. training/posttrain/open-instruct.patch
   A patch to allenai/open-instruct at commit
   d19de7d27ac2af2cd1dcbf856dba1a2d077b37f4 (open_instruct/finetune.py and
   open_instruct/dpo_tune_cache.py). It contains modified excerpts of these
   files.

4. training/midtrain/olmo-shared-fs-checkpoint.patch
   A patch to allenai/OLMo at commit 090253dac6688f2532509daa7aa2eb5fae50e956
   (https://github.com/allenai/OLMo). It contains modified excerpts of
   olmo/checkpoint.py.

5. training/posttrain/sft_args.sh, dpo_args.sh, rl_args.sh
   The command-line arguments of AI2's OLMo 2 1B post-training commands, as
   documented in docs/olmo2.md of allenai/open-instruct (a later revision of
   that repository; the file does not exist at the pinned commit), with local
   paths and bookkeeping options (run names, checkpoint retention, tracking,
   upload) changed.

Referenced or installed, but not included:

- AI2's stage-2 training configuration,
  configs/official-0425/OLMo2-1B-stage2-seed42.yaml of allenai/OLMo at commit
  090253dac6688f2532509daa7aa2eb5fae50e956 (Apache License 2.0). The scripts
  in training/midtrain/ read it from an OLMo checkout and check its SHA-256.
  training/midtrain/build_injection_stream_v2.py (make-config) writes a copy
  in which only the data paths, run name, output folder, checkpoint intervals
  and tracking keys are changed. That copy is a training output, not part of
  this repository.
- allenai/OLMo and allenai/open-instruct (Apache License 2.0). The recipes in
  env/ install them from their public repositories at the commits above. Their
  code is not redistributed here.
- GROBID 0.8.1 (Apache License 2.0), run as a separate service to convert
  arXiv PDFs.
- WikiExtractor 3.0.8 (GNU Affero General Public License v3 or later),
  installed as a separate package and run as a separate process by
  collection/wikipedia_dolma_text.py.
- The other Python packages listed in env/ and pyproject.toml, under their
  own licences.

Data, model weights and document texts are not part of this repository.
docs/data.md describes their sources and licences.
